                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                        "entry_id": "54171199-d763-3a84-b760-d0ab2d86496e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Recht der Presse (und anderer Medien), frei und ohne Zensur Informationen und Meinungen zu veröffentlichen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4acadba8-eede-41ea-84da-a14cf032057e",
                                "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                                "text": "In vielen Staaten ist die Pressefreiheit stark eingeschränkt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a6a0aec-5c68-40ef-887b-cd8007f0cbde",
                                "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                                "text": "„So stark war seine Verachtung der Journaille, so stark seine Achtung vor formaler Pressefreiheit.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f0ae755-a362-4bdf-b897-4cb3d3d5a941",
                                "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                                "text": "„Die Liste der Länder mit dem höchsten Grad der Pressefreiheit, den wenigsten Eingriffen, Bedrohungen und Zensur wird 2014 wieder von Finnland angeführt, gefolgt von den Niederlanden und Norwegen, Luxemburg und Adorra.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aef3a373-f0d6-4c42-9693-fdde9ed5117a",
                                "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                                "text": "„Auch auf unsere Presse- und Reisefreiheit sind wir stolz.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4694bb51-2f3f-496d-8565-737186485100",
                                "sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                                "text": "„Wicchtiger ist Wielands unerschüttertes und stets wiederholtes Bekenntnis zur Pressefreiheit.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "318807ba-c22e-47c5-9ae0-507f87001446",
                        "source_entry_id": "54171199-d763-3a84-b760-d0ab2d86496e",
                        "source_sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                        "target_lang_word": "新闻自由",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00f768bc-9c5c-43b8-8414-6daf815dac05",
                        "source_entry_id": "54171199-d763-3a84-b760-d0ab2d86496e",
                        "source_sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                        "target_lang_word": "freedom of the press",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "freedom of the press",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e770af0f-8fb5-3688-818f-d720e2795bf4",
                                        "entry_id": "93aa7513-e1bf-393c-9658-2834432aba1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The right of citizens or the media to print, or otherwise disseminate, speech, ideas and opinions without fear or harm of prosecution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12105c2b-646d-4fd3-9a1b-2a6ba5611d6b",
                                                "sense_id": "e770af0f-8fb5-3688-818f-d720e2795bf4",
                                                "text": "Since the press, commanding the service of every other means of communication, is the common carrier of information, delivering it almost instantly and simultaneously through out a nation, and there is no other carrier a thousandth part so efficient any restriction upon the information it may convey deprives every citizen in some degree of capacity for intelligent thought and wise action. This is obviously of great importance in relation to the affairs of government and that is why since its vital connection with the welfare of peoples has been understood, the freedom of the press has been so jealously guarded no more by its own servants than by the statesman, the publicist, and the enlightened citizen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a996c0-226d-448e-b654-1a72dc6cac38",
                                                "sense_id": "e770af0f-8fb5-3688-818f-d720e2795bf4",
                                                "text": "The term free speech, which appears in this book's subtitle as well as in its text, is used more or less interchangeably with freedom of the press, freedom of speech, and freedom of expression to refer to all of the expressive rights guaranteed by the forty-five words of the First Amendment, as interpreted by the U.S. courts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14f6cbde-0709-456a-a439-8c2d5c76b83f",
                        "source_entry_id": "54171199-d763-3a84-b760-d0ab2d86496e",
                        "source_sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                        "target_lang_word": "press freedom",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3485bc2f-355e-4a62-a436-f93126aabfd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "54171199-d763-3a84-b760-d0ab2d86496e",
                        "source_sense_id": "211258bd-f1e2-3f2c-baa9-215198aea073",
                        "target_lang_word": "liberté de la presse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "liberté de la presse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cce04c62-de4a-366e-8455-21ef2ff6db1e",
                                        "entry_id": "1dc78de2-e8ea-3140-9a51-5cf04fc8309e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Droit de manifester sa pensée par la voie de l’impression, et surtout par la voie des journaux, l’un des principes fondamentaux des systèmes démocratiques avec la liberté d’opinion et la liberté d’expression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42088d6d-f066-4198-b76c-f26ab1593396",
                                                "sense_id": "cce04c62-de4a-366e-8455-21ef2ff6db1e",
                                                "text": "Vingt-cinq millions de voix réclament la liberté de la presse ; la Nation et le Roi demandent unanimement le concours de toutes les lumières."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a38debc-4082-4351-93c9-e3a029cdc3ff",
                                                "sense_id": "cce04c62-de4a-366e-8455-21ef2ff6db1e",
                                                "text": "Ils le laissèrent sur le carreau les quatre fers en l'air, la bouche ensanglantée, gueulant des trucs incompréhensibles, genre poursuites pénales, dommages et intérêts, liberté de la presse, le tout au milieu d'une myriade de projos et de micros, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74e2f71b-645c-4501-8ba0-343e75f94c44",
                                                "sense_id": "cce04c62-de4a-366e-8455-21ef2ff6db1e",
                                                "text": "[Titre] Affaire Khashoggi : Dans sa dernière tribune, le journaliste évoquait la nécessaire liberté de la presse dans le monde arabe"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d6204a-b9ef-42f0-b9ea-54c9cf0c3f4a",
                                                "sense_id": "cce04c62-de4a-366e-8455-21ef2ff6db1e",
                                                "text": "depuis que la coalition d’extrême droite dirigée par Giorgia Meloni a pris le pouvoir en octobre 2022, la liberté de la presse a été soumise à une pression croissante, avec des attaques et des violations sans précédent, souvent initiées par des hommes politiques dans le but de marginaliser et de faire taire les opinions divergentes»"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
